{
  "_readme": [
    "Charts to check against 问真八字.",
    "",
    "Run `npm run verify` to print each one in a layout you can hold beside 问真.",
    "Then fill in the `wenzhen` block from what 问真 shows and run it again — any",
    "fixture with a filled block is diffed, and test/wenzhen.test.ts turns it into",
    "a permanent regression test.",
    "",
    "Transcribe only these fields. 藏干, 十神, 纳音 and 星运 all follow",
    "deterministically once the four pillars agree, and the invariant suite",
    "already proves those derivations.",
    "  pillars       four 干支, space separated, 年 月 日 时 ('--' for an unknown hour)",
    "  luckStartAge  起运 age as 问真 prints it",
    "  firstLuck     the first 大运 干支",
    "",
    "In 问真, set 真太阳时 to match `useTrueSolarTime` on each fixture."
  ],

